    path: "references/button-shapes-and-states.md",
    text: "# Button shapes and states\n\n## Apply this\n\n- If actions look inconsistent, choose one corner and surface treatment for each priority.\n- Compare rounded, square, raised, and icon variants against existing control tokens.\n- Verify focus, disabled, and pressed states; a different shape alone must not encode priority.\n\n## Source\n\nSource: `Component Gallery v1.1.0.pdf`, version 1.1.0, PDF pages 2–5.\nApply this is new guidance; the source blocks below preserve the supplied pypdf extraction verbatim.\nPage images preserve the original visual content, including text absent from extraction.\n\n## Source pages\n\n### Source page 2\n\n![Source PDF page 2](../assets/gallery-page-002.jpg)\n\n```text\nSmall rounded\nPrimaryDescription Secondary\nLarge rounded\nFull rounded\nPrimary\nPrimary\nPrimary\nOption A\nOption A\nOption A\nOption B\nOption B\nOption B\nOption C\nOption C\nOption C\nButtons\nRefactoring UI: Component Gallery\n```\n\n### Source page 3\n\n![Source PDF page 3](../assets/gallery-page-003.jpg)\n\n```text\nPrimaryDescription Secondary\nSquare\nUppercase text PRIMARY\nPrimary\nOPTION A\n OPTION B\n OPTION C\nOption A Option B Option C\nOption A\n Option B\n Option C\nVertical gradient Primary Option A\n Option B\n Option C\nHorizontal gradient Primary Option A\n Option B\n Option C\nWith soft shadow\n Primary\nRefactoring UI: Component Gallery\n```\n\n### Source page 4\n\n![Source PDF page 4](../assets/gallery-page-004.jpg)\n\n```text\nPrimaryDescription Secondary\nRaised with bottom profile\n Primary\n Option A\n Option B\n Option C\nRaised with top profile\nWith icon on left Primary Option A\n Option B\n Option C\nWith icon on right Primary Option A\n Option B\n Option C\nPrimary\n Option A\n Option B\n Option C\nRefactoring UI: Component Gallery\n```\n\n### Source page 5\n\n![Source PDF page 5](../assets/gallery-page-005.jpg)\n\n```text\n\n```\n",
